{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0261_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0261_story_02_title", "source_sha256": "f6117488b48fa59724336dfcbb5a24579f9f482ffd98013f4bd5ca042c5b43de", "ja": "あの日、宇宙であったこと", "zh": "那天在宇宙中发生的事", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0261_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0261_story_02_synopsis", "source_sha256": "18e7ca1c2131c277d03b007b82e03440ea19242000f16ae714b546a8cf2e5f87", "ja": "ドラマ版『☆ピコピコプラネット☆』のおさ\nらい。地球に不時着したミリオン星人たちは\n助けてくれた地球人のやよいを連れて、宇宙\n旅行へ！　たくさんの出会いと事件があって\n……詳しくは、ドラマをチェック！", "zh": "电视剧版『☆ピコピコプラネット☆』内容回顾。\n迫降在地球的百万星人们带上帮助过他们的地球人弥生，\n一起踏上宇宙旅行！经历了许多相遇和事件，\n……详情请查看剧情！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0261_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0261_story_02_1000_040tam", "source_sha256": "65c4ffce0e5647e3c6e561d1b5c6263c65878ad4a8f4ecc741067026a8c35e3a", "ja": "みんな、楽しかったでしょ～！\n『せーふく』されちゃったよね？　くふふ♪", "zh": "大家都玩得很开心吧～！\n被“征服”了对吧？嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0261_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0261_story_02_1001_022ser", "source_sha256": "c632526d7dacbb57079c65f43d37c9669283f40c343b41bc550a672d8388abd9", "ja": "まだこのお話を見たことがないお友達のために、\nちょっとだけ内容を教えちゃうね！", "zh": "为了还没有看过这个故事的小朋友，\n我就稍微透露一点点内容吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0261_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0261_story_02_1002_035hin", "source_sha256": "1e18e6ffb86ecea8c3b780e3d24c8c31fe3e492510bee1872b3f0188bfab8ad5", "ja": "あたしたち、宇宙のみんなと仲良くなるために、\n旅をしていたんだけど、宇宙船が故障してしまって。", "zh": "我们为了和宇宙里的大家成为好朋友，一直在旅行，可宇宙船却坏掉了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0261_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0261_story_02_1003_040tam", "source_sha256": "055cbe9cde1e331f278e418685a6961185b1778558bc7c0a71743002cb998e1a", "ja": "どうしよ～！　ってなったけど、不時着した地球で、\n地球人のやよいに助けてもらったんだ！", "zh": "虽然我们都要急死了～！不过在迫降到地球后，得到了地球人弥生的帮助！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0261_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0261_story_02_1004_024ann", "source_sha256": "33f0023f12082d5312003416d9a63cf7b6ad02bb0ac482a97de4ad0c32d20048", "ja": "ビビッ！　仲良し予感な電波をキャッチ！！", "zh": "哔哔！接收到预感会成为好朋友的电波啦！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0261_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0261_story_02_1005_024ann", "source_sha256": "0511ece6ee90963c06d96994723bc919afebcbe3f029c4006f49cc2d960d0fbf", "ja": "みんなで『せんのー』で『せーふく』！\nやよいとお友達になったのデース！", "zh": "大家一起『洗脑』然后『征服』！\n我和弥生变成好朋友啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0261_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0261_story_02_1006_035hin", "source_sha256": "0bc5c04532150da6e222a50a1e3f7a0dfc2af795165f1e088f468276a8a54100", "ja": "あのときご馳走になった地球のもやし炒め、\nなまらおいしかったねぇ。", "zh": "那时候吃到的地球炒豆芽，真是好吃得不得了呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0261_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0261_story_02_1007_040tam", "source_sha256": "70655fd945687810aeba0207e83fa59702a02d1fe9ba2fc26f1a2656734433f9", "ja": "スペースコブン号もむしゃむしゃ食べて\n元気満タン。また飛べるようになったんだ！", "zh": "连太空科布号也大口大口地吃饱了，精神满满，又能继续飞了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0261_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0261_story_02_1008_022ser", "source_sha256": "9db521c53ce75664922a2c8e4ea6b0677e9da77fcd538ede6037f828bc7dd3be", "ja": "だからわたし達、やよいさんも誘って、\n宇宙旅行に出かけて……。", "zh": "所以我们还邀请了弥生小姐，一起去宇宙旅行……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0261_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0261_story_02_1009_024ann", "source_sha256": "f784107652a26ba236655c75908d2a88659e8abf4f9a236da6e6808a66cd08a4", "ja": "そこで宇宙萩原組の雪歩さんや、植物の星の\nエレナさんと出会って、みんなと友達になったの！", "zh": "在那里遇到了宇宙萩原组的雪步小姐，还有植物星球的艾莲娜小姐，和大家成为了朋友！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0261_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0261_story_02_1010_022ser", "source_sha256": "654baccf340c779c92936b4986b48f8b6de158d7dc69e14f12907490f42e4dce", "ja": "わくわくでいっぱいの大冒険でした♪\n気になったお友達は、ドラマもチェックしてみてね！", "zh": "是一场充满了兴奋与期待的大冒险呢♪\n感兴趣的小朋友们，也要记得去看看电视剧哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0261_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0261_story_02_1011_040tam", "source_sha256": "e3f019321df424287f6c8da12bc140f9722ac08dde97fb89e9ed64253b3ad873", "ja": "今日もここに来る途中、\n土星のゆきほのところに寄ってきたんだぞ～！", "zh": "今天来这里的路上，\n我还顺便去了一趟土星上的雪步那里哦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0261_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0261_story_02_1012_040tam", "source_sha256": "3d779d871fa4689dcf73c72953f7854e827dbdfbdaa31784d6a59d463eef3c2b", "ja": "知ってた？　土星の輪っかって、\n宇宙萩原組のドーナツ工場なんだよ！", "zh": "你知道吗？土星环啊，\n其实是宇宙萩原组的甜甜圈工厂哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0261_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0261_story_02_1013_022ser", "source_sha256": "cfdd7a270a9cc251a0654cf2c3856b5f830f342a72da579d46cdb7db931fb8d2", "ja": "最近はアステロイドベルトに住んでる\n宇宙人さん達にドーナツを配達してるんだって！", "zh": "最近还在给住在小行星带的外星人们送甜甜圈呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0261_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0261_story_02_1014_035hin", "source_sha256": "540a04fe4c281d760866a87f542a5ab6298c7655e37fe20a6f7e6ead6ed2a84d", "ja": "あのあたりの小惑星はお店も少なくて、\n巨大ドーナツは好評なんだぁ。", "zh": "那一带的小行星店面也很少，\n巨大甜甜圈很受欢迎呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0261_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0261_story_02_1015_035hin", "source_sha256": "9348e6b6eac61a83543cfdea1398f3daed9293cf8d1fca8841e881504b0dce81", "ja": "ひとつ買ったら、10年間は朝昼晩、\nドーナツが食べられるって！", "zh": "听说买一个，就能在10年间早中晚都吃到甜甜圈呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0261_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0261_story_02_1016_035hin", "source_sha256": "a6c14bf4742d8a2ae082d08ee73db3d3b49037d0626fc3ca51421684f7319dbb", "ja": "次は地球にも、ドーナツ工場を\n作ろうかって考えてるみたいだよぉ。", "zh": "听说下一个目标，是要在地球上也建一座甜甜圈工厂呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0261_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0261_story_02_1017_040tam", "source_sha256": "7e751983c2dbeda82f879a3b337a835ff450f2a861bc3a3e3452bdc571fbe879", "ja": "ええ、それってもしかして……\n地球にも土星みたいに輪っかができちゃうの！？", "zh": "诶，那该不会是……\n地球也会像土星一样长出环吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0261_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0261_story_02_1018_024ann", "source_sha256": "fd963fa1987751030ace944ab06e5fd3d8d05209741ac3852f61e34d09c4a379", "ja": "そうしたら地球でも\nドーナツいっぱい食べられちゃうね♪", "zh": "这样一来，在地球上也能吃好多甜甜圈了呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0261_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0261_story_02_1019_022ser", "source_sha256": "a546a3ca5f4a6ac783ee086b94e92105a2ea40f57aa1d76864f36eaf0b22b3a8", "ja": "エレナさんも今度地球に来たいって言ってましたよ。\n地球のお日様を浴びて、光合成してみたいって！", "zh": "艾莲娜也说过，下次想来地球看看呢。\n她想晒晒地球的阳光，试试看能不能进行光合作用！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0261_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0261_story_02_1020_040tam", "source_sha256": "3574fabecb7fa9ad8e5c4736e52f38ce8a98f3063c0547c74d28eb12b4b979bf", "ja": "みんな食いしん坊だな～、くふふ♪\n……話してたら、たまきもお腹すいてきちゃった。", "zh": "大家都是贪吃鬼呢～，嘿嘿♪\n……聊着聊着，环的肚子也饿起来了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0261_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0261_story_02_1021_040tam", "source_sha256": "5f1e55994c0cf194a0ce399da9e8a6f2599d7af56f817cdc0f4e7510de90b07f", "ja": "そうだ！　ゆきほにもらったお土産、\n食べちゃおう……か、なっと……。", "zh": "对了！雪步送我的伴手礼，吃掉吧……还是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0261_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0261_story_02_1022_se", "source_sha256": "6d63eb5bb05b1b431156fd114ea065116f2146e6194097910dfd7347fb5a2836", "ja": "ガサガサ", "zh": "沙沙", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0261_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0261_story_02_1023_040tam", "source_sha256": "7e4a7b2272a09b45c51fdf56ecba7169c13b590e6f8cab79562b459fc7f751f5", "ja": "あ～～！？　紙袋が空っぽになってる！", "zh": "啊～～！？纸袋变空了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0261_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0261_story_02_1024_040tam", "source_sha256": "4f141805df6cc405901749dd54639aeca8edb9542c614530a6184658300957fb", "ja": "コブン、お土産のドーナツ全部食べちゃったの！？\nうぅ～……。", "zh": "小弟，你把伴手礼的甜甜圈全吃掉了吗！？\n呜呜～……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0261_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0261_story_02_1025_035hin", "source_sha256": "8e44d9c7c1af5cb9904a8aadd393aa6fcf76d26805df28925e80ac41f6263f35", "ja": "まあまあ、環ちゃん。\nあんまりおやつを食べ過ぎないほうがいいでしょや。", "zh": "好啦好啦，环。\n零食还是别吃太多比较好呀。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0261_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0261_story_02_1026_035hin", "source_sha256": "3bf09fe4804556d47b91a80a0ee6d658b29581ef3a8e3f517fffb880f182c1b3", "ja": "このあと、やよいさんのおうちでもやしパーティー\nなんだから、お腹すかせておかないとねぇ。", "zh": "接下来还要去弥生姐姐家办豆芽派对，所以得先把肚子空出来才行呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0261_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0261_story_02_1027_040tam", "source_sha256": "85d2beb2a2a6d07fc1f9edc33a9877d6532b46ae47d027b3bf750904d3689b01", "ja": "そうだった！　やよいのもやし炒めは、宇宙規模の\nエネルギーだもんね。お腹すかせておかなくちゃ♪", "zh": "对哦！やよい做的炒豆芽可是宇宙级的力量呢。得先把肚子空出来才行♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0261_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0261_story_02_1028_035hin", "source_sha256": "d535a4013f3433808638208933269504a71c26587590fc79d41a14ae9cb75e22", "ja": "その前に、まずは番組をがんばらないとねぇ。", "zh": "在那之前，首先得努力做好节目才行呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0261_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0261_story_02_1029_024ann", "source_sha256": "fc428cf9371e73266001e86b7a59ddf8dccd467b82516c2b015b63f6267a06f9", "ja": "よーし、スペースアイドル杏奈におまかせ！\n次のコーナー、ビビッと受信したよ！", "zh": "好——就交给太空偶像杏奈吧！\n下一个环节，我已经哔哔接收到了哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0261_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0261_story_02_1030_024ann", "source_sha256": "346cfc4018e0bf082dcbcba06f84dac5e953320879f009677b20a95cdf2f35af", "ja": "次は……地球の子ども達みんなと、\nランデヴーしちゃうよ！　お楽しみにね！", "zh": "接下来……要和地球上的孩子们一起，来一场约会哦！敬请期待！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
